```sql
CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS users (
    id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY,
    username TEXT UNIQUE NOT NULL,
    password_hash TEXT NOT NULL
);
```

When registering a user, hash the password with `werkzeug.security.generate_password_hash()` before inserting it. Keep `FLASK_SECRET_KEY` out of your source code, use HTTPS in production, and add CSRF protection if these endpoints are used by browser forms.

